# Cortisstyle design inspiration (not boutiques)

When designing Cortisstyle home, lookbook, wardrobe, or AI discovery UX, read `docs/agent-handoffs/11-cortisstyle-design-inspiration.md` and open the listed sites — especially each **What we like** section.

- Brunello Cucinelli AI (`/en-gb/ai`): first-run **info cards** that teach the best experience, plus the full flow of **typing what you want** to discover looks/products.
- Dolce & Gabbana gift finder quiz: guided **quiz → recommendations** pattern — adapt to clothing (occasion/vibe/look), not beauty.
- These references are for **Cortisstyle**, not `/tr/[slug]` boutique storefronts (see `10-boutique-design-inspiration.md` for boutiques).
- Do not copy assets, branding, or build a pixel clone.
